Scenario 2: ANN Fails to Learn Non-Linear Patterns
Project: Simple digit classification using Artificial Neural Network (ANN)
Problem: Accuracy stuck around 50%; adding more epochs doesn’t improve performance.


| Field    | Details                                                                                                                   |
| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Project  | Digit Classification using ANN                                                                                            |
| Problem  | Accuracy remains around 50% even after increasing epochs.                                                                 |
| Cause    | ANN cannot effectively capture complex non-linear image features.                                                         |
| Solution | 1. Replace ANN with CNN for image tasks.<br>2. Normalize input images.<br>3. Use ReLU activation instead of Sigmoid/Tanh. |

