Scenario 4: Object Detection Model Detects Objects but Bounding Boxes Are Misaligned
 Project: YOLOv8 used for Tiger Detection in Forest
 Problem: Bounding boxes do not fit objects properly.

| Field    | Details                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Project  | Tiger Detection using YOLOv8                                                                                                                                                                |
| Problem  | Detected bounding boxes do not fit the objects correctly.                                                                                                                                   |
| Cause    | Incorrect annotation format or labeling errors.                                                                                                                                             |
| Solution | 1. Verify YOLO annotation format: (class_id, x_center, y_center, width, height).<br>2. Ensure coordinates are normalized.<br>3. Validate labels using Roboflow or CVAT visualization tools. |


