Scenario 5: Face Mask Detection Gives High Accuracy but Performs Poorly on Real Faces
Project: Real-time Face Mask Detection using CNN 
Problem: High accuracy on test set, but poor real-time performance on webcam feed.


| Field    | Details                                                                                                                                                                        |
| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Project  | Real-Time Face Mask Detection using CNN                                                                                                                                        |
| Problem  | High test accuracy but poor webcam performance.                                                                                                                                |
| Cause    | Training images differ from real-world webcam images in lighting and angles.                                                                                                   |
| Solution | 1. Apply Data Augmentation (brightness, flip, rotation).<br>2. Collect webcam images and fine-tune the model.<br>3. Include diverse lighting and face angles in training data. |


