Scenario 6: CNN-Based Object Detector Struggles at Night
Project: YOLOv8-based object detection in CCTV
Problem: Model doesn’t detect objects in dark/night images


| Field    | Details                                                                                                                                                |
| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Project  | YOLOv8-based CCTV Object Detection                                                                                                                     |
| Problem  | Model fails to detect objects in dark or night images.                                                                                                 |
| Cause    | Training data lacks night-time and low-light images.                                                                                                   |
| Solution | 1. Train with night-mode images.<br>2. Apply brightness and contrast augmentation.<br>3. Use Histogram Equalization or CLAHE preprocessing techniques. |


